        "id": 1060831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-21T13:40:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Except that diffferent bssl calls return success/failure in different ways, e.g. returning null may (or may not) indicate an error.\n\nAlso it\u0027s not really validating it, it\u0027s mapping it to a Result.",
